                </Property>
                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&lt;html&gt;**Individuals with conditions that increase their risks of developing coronary&#xa0;heart disease, such as&#xa0;high blood pressure, diabetes,&#xa0;cigarette smoking, high blood cholesterol, or having family members who had early onset&#xa0;heart attacks&#xa0;and coronary&#xa0;heart disease.&lt;/html&gt;"/>
